[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8162.629, "timestamp": "02:16:02", "text": "聽起來像是很久以前的事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8167.109, "timestamp": "02:16:07", "text": "確切地。很久以前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8168.95, "timestamp": "02:16:08", "text": "雖然只有一年，但感覺好像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8170.87, "timestamp": "02:16:10", "text": "很久以前的事了。  確切地。  一切都結束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8184.709, "timestamp": "02:16:24", "text": "[音樂]，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8187.27, "timestamp": "02:16:27", "text": "我的意思是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.43, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "算了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8196.309, "timestamp": "02:16:36", "text": "歡迎來到 Koon，你甚至還沒完成。  啊，對，就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8198.15, "timestamp": "02:16:38", "text": "那個遊戲。你還"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8200.15, "timestamp": "02:16:40", "text": "記得我送你的那款"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8205.83, "timestamp": "02:16:45", "text": "恐怖遊戲嗎？  是的。 [笑聲] 啊，這遊戲真嚇人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8207.91, "timestamp": "02:16:47", "text": "你玩"}]